Apache License, Version 2.0.

  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Derived files carry a note in their module docstring. The detection stage
follows that project's RT-DETR adapter and model manager; the YOLO paths, and
with them the AGPL-3.0 `ultralytics` dependency, are not carried over.

Model weights are not distributed with this repository. The detector is
`ogkalu/comic-text-and-bubble-detector` (Apache-2.0), downloaded on first run.
